#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`pqc-enforcement-policy` does more than enforce post-quantum key exchange: it controls which SSL engine Vert.x selects.\n"
"Setting `pqc-enforcement-policy` to `client-negotiated` or `strict` activates the native OpenSSL engine (requires OpenSSL 3.5+), which negotiates post-quantum key exchange groups.\n"
